No licence is granted at this time.

This repository is private. A licence will be chosen only after two open
decisions are resolved, in this order:

  D-1  rights to methodology developed during employment (requires legal review)
  D-2  choice of licence for open release

Until both are resolved, this file must not be replaced with an open-source
licence text. Choosing a licence is a legal act, not a formatting step, and
picking a plausible default here would be exactly the kind of invented fact the
methodology in this repository exists to prevent.
